        "handoff.logical.trade.owning_customer_effective_from->logical.holding_change.owning_customer_effective_from"
      ],
      "reads": [
        "raw.holding_history",
        "governed.trade"
      ],
      "note": "inv.holding_change_not_constructed (selected in review.json) is deterministic: false and has no SQL audit here, mirroring trade-lifecycle's own treatment of its analogous inv.trade_not_constructed: sources-v1.json anchors no ce.* source for holding changes, so there is nothing this job's SQL could check for an unlabeled constructed fact."
