  "questions_for_authority": [
    "A (original_trade_number, current_trade_number) pair whose only raw.holding_history reports carry cdc_flag D is excluded entirely by this job's latest_change selector, so no logical.holding_change row is ever created for it, and it never enters an account_position or customer_position sum. hole.deletions reserves what a D-flagged report means for a holding change, including whether a row should exist for such a pair (e.g. zeroed out, or carrying its last pre-deletion values) rather than being omitted. This is stated as the current, unchanged behavior, decided nowhere but in this job's SQL; it is not resolved here."
